  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The glyph is drawn in red as one unbroken line that never crosses itself.</p><p>Over 1 minute, you can set this ward in an unoccupied space within reach. When a creature enters that space, the ward goes off: the creature that triggers it must succeed on a [[/save ability=wis dc=16 format=long]] or it has the &amp;Reference[Paralyzed apply=false] condition for 2 rounds. At the end of each of its turns, the creature repeats the save, ending the effect on itself on a success. The ward is then spent. A creature that spots it can disarm it with a [[/check ability=dex dc=16 format=long]].</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
